WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.846 --> 00:00:04.715
(intense music)

00:00:04.715 --> 00:00:05.643
(crowd cheers)

00:00:05.643 --> 00:00:06.476
- [Male Commentator] Can he?

00:00:06.476 --> 00:00:07.309
Yes!

00:00:07.309 --> 00:00:09.604
(indistinct)

00:00:09.604 --> 00:00:10.437
Yes!

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:13.590
- [Female News Reporter]
The Coronavirus crisis

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.600
is a situation unlike anything

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.520
this country has faced in living memory.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.590
- [Pep Guardiola] Some
things are more important

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:20.423
than football.

00:00:20.423 --> 00:00:22.100
If people cannot watch the games,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.000
there is no sense.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.250
- [Chris] I'm Chris, a YouTube creator,

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.220
and my channel is built on
my passion for football.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.720
This is the England manager.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.556
The man with one of the
biggest jobs in world football.

00:00:33.556 --> 00:00:34.620
- [Gareth Southgate] You
know, I was always brought up

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.080
and told that, throughout your career,

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.440
respect the game, it's an important thing.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.500
- [Chris] And so, through myself,

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.340
and three fellow YouTube creators,

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.310
Yung Filly,

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:43.480
SV2,

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.810
and Stunt Pegg,

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.320
he's gonna connect with
football's grass roots.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.310
- If ever anybody ever
asked me, when I was a kid,

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.143
what was my ambition?

00:00:50.143 --> 00:00:51.883
It would have been to play for England.

00:00:53.644 --> 00:00:55.900
- Let me show you what a YouTuber can do.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.684
I'll see you, I'll see
you on the pitch, bruv.

00:00:57.684 --> 00:00:59.240
- Hopefully, hopefully.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.090
- [Stunt Pegg] As a young girl,

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:01.400
there was absolutely no way

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.610
that I could become a footballer.

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.360
I just saw it as a hobby.

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:05.650
- Sports is a beautiful thing, innit.

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:07.210
Brings people together, bruv.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.570
Watching my stuff, you wouldn't think

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:09.750
I'm the sort of guy that can have

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.210
some sort of mental health issue.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.345
And I felt like it was
important for me to share that.

00:01:14.345 --> 00:01:15.178
Sorry.

00:01:17.393 --> 00:01:19.810
(indistinct)

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:24.590
- [Chris] The Euro's
are back on this summer,

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:26.090
and it feels like, for the first time,

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:28.560
we've got reason to be optimistic.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.130
- [Yung Filly] I love
international football.

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:30.963
Going out in the sun,

00:01:30.963 --> 00:01:31.920
going to watch a football game,

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:32.753
I love that, I can't wait.

00:01:32.753 --> 00:01:34.110
- [Stunt Pegg] When I think about a nation

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.700
that had a lot of resentment
for its national team,

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:38.327
all of a sudden, come together.

00:01:38.327 --> 00:01:39.760
- [Gareth Southgate]
That's the beauty of sport.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.460
We always want our fans to be excited

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.520
by watching the team.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:44.350
We need that togetherness and spirit

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:47.130
that drives the team and
allows it to achieve.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.470
We have that sense of pride

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.320
and we absolutely have that ambition.

